\
STRUCTURAL AND DESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\
- Header: Full-width upscale header with a chic typographic SVG logo, smooth navigation menu in French (Le Salon, Tarifs, Galerie, Contact), and a "Prendre RDV" button.\
- Hero Section: Full-width layout featuring an immersive Unsplash image of a trendy haircut/portrait (e.g., "modern hair salon styling"), refined French typography, and a brand slogan.\
- SVG Icons: Discreet, elegant inline SVG pictograms for the service menu (haircuts, hair coloring, smoothing treatments, event styling).\
- Unsplash Images: Instagram-style visual gallery integrating high-definition Unsplash photos of haircuts and hair colorings.\
- Fake Contact Form: An online appointment request form with French dropdowns for selecting hair treatments and a fictional date picker.\
- Footer: Full-width dark footer displaying opening hours, physical address, social media links, and French legal notices.\
- Color Palette: Matte black (#18181b), nude beige (#f5f5f4), soft gold (#d4af37), and crisp white.\
- Responsive: Smooth, high-end responsive layout scaling seamlessly across all devices.}